          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scan first to list what can be cleaned. Nothing is cleaned until you’ve reviewed and checked it; by default items go to the Trash and can be restored.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先掃描並列出可清理的項目。你看過、勾選之後才會清理；預設移到垃圾桶，可以復原。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scan the same location again later to see which folders grew or shrank.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "之後再掃描同一個位置，就能看到哪些資料夾變大或變小。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scanned %@ files · %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已掃描 %@ 個檔案 · %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scanning for items to clean…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在掃描可清理的項目…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
